StarNet CIFAR-10 assignment adaptation

The StarNet block in src/models.py follows the architecture implemented by
Xu Ma and collaborators in Rewrite the Stars (CVPR 2024).
Official repository: https://github.com/ma-xu/Rewrite-the-Stars
Inspected commit: c999eb50840a44f9f1d92e8f7d2c22cd645a6d5e

The upstream Apache License 2.0 and inspected source are retained in
docs/sources/StarNet-LICENSE and docs/sources/official_starnet.py.
Modifications include a CIFAR-10 stem/head, smaller stage configuration,
an additive operator ablation and a separate training/evaluation pipeline.
The project does not claim endorsement by the paper's authors.
